{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54278","headline":"读傅大士法身偈後作偈 · 本寂","name":"读傅大士法身偈後作偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渠本不是我，（非我）我本不是渠。\n（非渠）渠无我即死，（仰汝取活）我无渠即余。\n（不别有）渠如我即佛，（要且不是佛）我如渠即驴。\n（二俱不立）不食空王俸，（若遇御饭直须吐却）何假鴈传书。\n（不通信）我说横声唱，（爲信唱）君看背上毛。\n（不与尔相似）乍如谣《白雪》，（将谓是《白雪》）犹恐是巴歌。\n（传此句无注）（以上十首均见《大正新修大藏经》第四七册《抚州曹山元证禅师语录》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"本寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}